# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

Manages a host directory.

Deletion refuses the filesystem root, target user's home, provider runtime, and
active Terraform working directory. Recursive deletion also refuses any parent
tree that contains one of those protected paths.

## Example Usage

{{ tffile "examples/resources/host_dir/resource.tf" }}

## Import

Import an existing directory by path. The provider reads its current mode and
defaults `recursive_delete` to `false`:

```shell
terraform import host_dir.projects '~/projects'
```

